,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120076","id":4650963211,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFTgRCw","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-08T16:10:34Z","updated_at":"2026-06-08T16:10:34Z","body":"The better solution would be to fix the actual issue that physics nodes have nothing that notifies them when the debug toggle changes. Could be as simple as connecting the node queue redraw to a global signal for that debug hint property.\r\n\r\nThe current documentation hint that this property is not design for runtime changes might as well be reworded to \"no one bothered to connect the nodes to a signal\" because that is the real reason why it does not work, not because it is technically really constrained.\r\n\r\nCausing a flood of redraw calls propagated throughout the entire SceneTree affecting everything is not really a solution that should be promoted. While it forces the debug to update it is basically a hack that causes performance problems and other unwanted side effects.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4650963211/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4736298667","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120076#issuecomment-4736298667","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120076","id":4736298667,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGk4uqw","user":{"login":"bennbollay","id":3607121,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDcxMjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3607121?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bennbollay","html_url":"https://github.com/bennbollay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bennbollay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bennbollay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bennbollay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bennbollay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bennbollay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bennbollay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bennbollay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bennbollay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bennbollay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-17T23:05:15Z","updated_at":"2026-06-17T23:05:15Z","body":"@smix8 Absolutely there's a much better systemic solution, however I do not have the time nor the bandwidth to put that PR together.  In the mean time, this approach helped unblock me from the issue that was preventing me from moving forward in my project, which is why I threw together the PR for the documentation update.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4736298667/reactions","total